WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
The learned policy begins lowering Spot's body. The arm remains stowed.

00:08.000 --> 00:20.000
Spot bends its legs further. A readout shows actual and target body height.

00:20.000 --> 00:26.000
The body approaches a 24-centimeter height target and begins a low hold.
